WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.042
"Tell us, Cow," said Cat.

2
00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:14.428
"Tell us how to make a wish."

3
00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:19.078
Cow said, "Walk around the well three times.

4
00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:24.031
Say, 'Please, please, pretty please.'"

5
00:00:24.032 --> 00:00:39.370
Cow went around the well.

6
00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:44.978
She said, "Please, please, pretty please."

7
00:00:44.979 --> 00:00:50.681
Then Cat went around the well.

8
00:00:50.682 --> 00:00:56.649
She said, "Please, please, pretty please" too.

9
00:00:56.650 --> 00:01:04.049
Then Bat went around the well.

10
00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:09.814
He said, "Please, please, pretty please" too.

11
00:01:09.815 --> 00:01:13.424
Cow said, "Now sing to the well.

12
00:01:13.425 --> 00:01:16.810
You must sing your wish."

13
00:01:16.811 --> 00:01:21.700
Cat sang, "I'm tired of this farm.

14
00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:24.982
I think it is a bore.

15
00:01:24.983 --> 00:01:34.459
I want to see new places I've never seen before."

16
00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.902
"I can't sing," said Bat.

17
00:01:37.903 --> 00:01:41.146
"I will not get my wish."

18
00:01:41.147 --> 00:01:44.686
Cow said, "Just try, Bat."

19
00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:47.655
But Bat was too sad.

20
00:01:47.656 --> 00:01:50.963
"It will not work," he said.

21
00:01:50.964 --> 00:01:57.133
"I must fly away now."

